{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","灿烂花语"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","華麗な花言葉"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一个目标标记“花语”，之后对场上所有被“花语”标记的目标造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵1体に「花のささやき」を付与。その後、「花のささやき」が付与された敵に範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对一名未被“花语”标记的敌人标记“花语”直至战斗结束，之后对所有被“花语”标记目标以及周围1格的敌人造成480% ATK伤害。被攻击的目标在2秒内受到多次该技能伤害时，后续伤害均降低20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「花のささやき」状態でない敵1体に、「花のささやき」を永続的に付与し、「花のささやき」状態の敵とその周囲1マスの敵に480% ATKのダメージを与える。同じ敵が2秒間内に、このスキルによるダメージを複数回受けた場合、2回目以降のダメージ-20%"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":58,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至490% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが490% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每个被标记“花语”的敌人被击败时，帕瑞莎在接下来的5秒内每秒回复60 + 20点能量。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「花のささやき」のマークが付いた敵が撃破されるたびに、5秒間、自身のSPが毎秒60 + 20回復"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至510% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが510% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至520% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/de